{"sections":[{"slug":"严格2-群胚","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"严格2-群胚"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> 2-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"严格 2-群胚"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚是所有态射和</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射均可逆的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/严格2-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> 2-<span lang=\"zh\">截断生象的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为连通</span> $2$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">形如</span>\n$$\r\nX = \\tau_{\\leq 2} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq 1} X  \\to \\tau_{\\leq 0} X = *.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其纤维为</span>\n$$\r\nK(\\pi_1(X),1) = \\tau_{\\leq 1} X,\r\n$$\n$$\r\nK(\\pi_2(X),2) = \\operatorname{fib}(X\\to\\tau_{\\leq 1}X),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">从而有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nK(\\pi_2(X),2) \\to X \\to K(\\pi_1(X),1).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}